periods when I believed

614
00:15:39,547 --> 00:15:40,150
I knew everything.

615
00:15:41,432 --> 00:15:42,209
They were the periods

616
00:15:42,234 --> 00:15:43,276
when I read the most,

617
00:15:43,898 --> 00:15:45,181
asked the most questions,

618
00:15:45,823 --> 00:15:46,706
made mistakes,

619
00:15:47,347 --> 00:15:48,410
and corrected them quickly.

620
00:15:49,973 --> 00:15:51,059
I wasn't a genius,

621
00:15:51,742 --> 00:15:52,667
and I wasn't lucky

622
00:15:52,828 --> 00:15:53,230
every time.

623
00:15:54,396 --> 00:15:55,359
I was an ordinary

624
00:15:55,419 --> 00:15:56,502
person who learned a

625
00:15:56,582 --> 00:15:58,367
few boring lessons and

626
00:15:58,407 --> 00:15:59,610
repeated them stubbornly.

627
00:16:00,894 --> 00:16:02,484
Nobody explained those lessons

628
00:16:02,524 --> 00:16:03,088
to me when I

629
00:16:03,128 --> 00:16:03,478
was 19.

630
00:16:04,691 --> 00:16:05,269
I had to learn

631
00:16:05,294 --> 00:16:06,297
them through trial,

632
00:16:06,739 --> 00:16:08,405
embarrassment, failure,

633
00:16:09,068 --> 00:16:09,590
and time.

634
00:16:11,154 --> 00:16:11,718
You don't need to

635
00:16:11,779 --> 00:16:13,350
make every mistake I made.

636
00:16:14,255 --> 00:16:14,859
And you don't need

637
00:16:14,900 --> 00:16:15,525
to wait for the

638
00:16:15,605 --> 00:16:16,230
perfect moment.

639
00:16:17,220 --> 00:16:17,790
There isn't one.

640
00:16:18,894 --> 00:16:19,821
The market will never

641
00:16:19,902 --> 00:16:20,950
feel completely safe.

642
00:16:21,834 --> 00:16:22,842
Your income will never

643
00:16:22,922 --> 00:16:23,970
feel quite high enough.

644
00:16:24,952 --> 00:16:25,980
Your schedule will never

645
00:16:26,101 --> 00:16:27,250
suddenly become empty.

646
00:16:28,612 --> 00:16:29,383
Start with what you

647
00:16:29,424 --> 00:16:29,870
have today.

648
00:16:31,175 --> 00:16:32,470
Build an emergency fund.

649
00:16:33,571 --> 00:16:34,493
Read one book.

650
00:16:35,215 --> 00:16:37,059
Learn one useful skill.

651
00:16:38,022 --> 00:16:39,124
Open a small account.

652
00:16:40,107 --> 00:16:41,570
Write down one business idea.

653
00:16:42,752 --> 00:16:43,674
Take one amount,

654
00:16:43,935 --> 00:16:44,717
however small,

655
00:16:45,298 --> 00:16:46,681
and stop spending it.

656
00:16:47,944 --> 00:16:49,066
Time is the only

657
00:16:49,147 --> 00:16:50,309
form of capital you

658
00:16:50,349 --> 00:16:51,472
can never earn back.

659
00:16:52,455 --> 00:16:53,417
Every day you wait

660
00:16:53,718 --> 00:16:54,781
is already gone.

661
00:16:55,984 --> 00:16:56,927
Ten years from now,

662
00:16:57,288 --> 00:16:57,985
you will look back

663
00:16:58,010 --> 00:16:58,360
at this

664
00:17:03,583 --> 00:17:04,302
I hope you say,

665
00:17:04,327 --> 00:17:06,137
I'm glad I started

666
00:17:06,218 --> 00:17:06,580
that day.

667
00:17:08,049 --> 00:17:08,660
Start today.

668
00:17:10,083 --> 00:17:11,131
Tomorrow has a habit

669
00:17:11,172 --> 00:17:12,220
of becoming another.
